  "body": "Deceased Estate - a genuine opportunity that must be sold!\r\n\r\n* Generous 979sqm (more or less) freehold site.\r\n* Zoned for Campbells Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Westlake Boys' and Westlake Girls' High Schools\r\n* Easy walk to local schools, Castor Bay Beach and nearby cafes.\r\n* Built in 1971 for the current owners who have lived in and cared for the property ever since.\r\n* Each room elegantly reflects the home's 1970's heritage.\r\n* Solid construction with great bones and plenty of potential.\r\n\r\nIf you've been searching for a genuine Bays do-up, a sizeable freehold section and a home where your hard work could make a real difference, put this one firmly on your viewing list.\r\n\r\nBring your vision. Bring your toolbox. Bring your imagination. The opportunity is here, and it has to be sold. Get in touch today or risk being disappointed by a SOLD sign.\r\n\r\nSee the potential for yourself - get in touch today to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nHarcourts property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/Y4VY",
